        "notes": "Evening cruise with views of illuminated monuments"
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Update Trip Day

  Update any field of an existing trip day.

  ## URL Params
  - `{trip_day_id}`: ID of the trip day to update

  ## Request Body
  All fields are optional - only include fields you want to update:
  - `date`: Change the calendar date
  - `day_number`: Change the sequential day number
  - `day_type`: Change the day type
  - `title`: Update the day title
  - `place`, `place_city`, `place_country`, `timezone`: Update location
  - `transit_mode`, `transit_details`: Update transit information
  - `arrival_time`, `departure_time`: Update arrival/departure timestamps
  - `accommodation_*`: Update accommodation details
  - `activities`: Replace entire activities array
  - `bookings`: Replace entire bookings array
  - `notes`: Update notes

  ## Important Notes
  - Only trip owner can update (for now)
  - If changing date, new date must be unique for the trip
  - Activities and bookings are REPLACED (not merged) when updated
  - Auto-updates trip destinations if location changed

  ## Example Usage
  - Update just the title: `{"title": "New Title"}`
  - Add more activities: Send full array with old + new activities
  - Change location: `{"place_city": "London", "place_country": "UK", "timezone": "Europe/London"}`
}
